[{"answer":"There are many different animals that you can have for pets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/1.mp3"},{"answer":"The most common pets are cats and dogs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the second most common pets are birds and fish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/3.mp3"},{"answer":"You can hug a cat or a dog.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/4.mp3"},{"answer":"You can play with a cat or a dog,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/5.mp3"},{"answer":"but it is difficult to play with a bird or a fish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Some birds are very smart, and they can be taught to do things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Parrots are very clever. Some of them even talk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Birds usually stay in birdcages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Fish have to stay in the water in a tank or a fishbowl.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people have gerbils or guinea pigs as pets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/11.mp3"},{"answer":"There are even people who have ferrets as pets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I have a friend who has a lizard for a pet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/13.mp3"},{"answer":"She has to buy live crickets for her lizard to eat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Another friend of mine has a pet snake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think I would like to have a pet snake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/16.mp3"},{"answer":"There are different types of dogs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Some dogs are very big, and some are small.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/18.mp3"},{"answer":"A Labrador retriever is a big dog.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/19.mp3"},{"answer":"A poodle is usually a small dog,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/20.mp3"},{"answer":"although there are some large poodles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Some dogs are noisy, and they bark a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Other dogs are quiet and obedient.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I once had a dog. It was a Cocker Spaniel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I used to take it for walks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/25.mp3"},{"answer":"There are different types of cats too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/26.mp3"},{"answer":"My favorite type of cat is a Siamese cat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Siamese cats have blue eyes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/28.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother had a Persian cat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/29.mp3"},{"answer":"It was very furry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/30.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother said that it used to shed fur all over the house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Pets are a lot of fun, but they are a lot of work too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/32.mp3"},{"answer":"To be a good pet owner, you have to be very responsible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/51-pets-2019-03-29-10-20-24/33.mp3"}]
